Step 10 – Configure the environment variables for AgentCore
Objective: Ensure the AgentCore development process can access the model configuration.

Your earlier export commands were executed in the parent Terminal session. Depending on how agentcore dev launches its environment, those variables may not automatically be available.

We'll create a project-level .env file.

Run:
cat > .env <<EOF
AWS_REGION=${AWS_REGION}
AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=${AWS_REGION}
MODEL_PROVIDER=bedrock
MODEL_ID=amazon.nova-lite-v1:0
MODEL_INFERENCE_PROFILE_ARN=${MODEL_INFERENCE_PROFILE_ARN}
EOF

